    "beschreibung": "The project, funded under the AGRIP – MULTI – 2025 – IM – ORGANIC topic. Lead Organisation: CONSORZIO TUTELA VINI D’ABRUZZO Partner: ODG DES PREMIERES COTES DE BORDEAUX ET CADILLAC Products being promoted – organic wines: - ABRUZZO DOP - CERASUOLO D’ABRUZZO DOP - COLLINE PESCARESI IGP - COLLINE TEATINE IGP - COLLINE TERAMANE MONTEPULCIANO D’ABRUZZO DOP - CONTROGUERRA DOP - DEL VASTESE OHISTONIUM IGP - MONTELPUCIANO D’ABRUZZO DOP - TERRE ABRUZZESI O TERRE D’ABRUZZO IGP - TERRE DI CHIETI IGP - TREBBIANO D’ABRUZZO DOP - VILLAMAGNA DOP - CADILLAC DOP - CADILLAC COTES DE BORDEAUX DOP - CÔTES DOP - PREMIÈRES CÔTES DE BORDEAUX The IB must present a set of activities and initiatives (informative and promotional) developed around the above-mentioned strategy oriented towards markets and target groups, aimed at achieving the above objectives and consistent with the EU message presented during the project application phase, with the expected duration and financial resources made available. Work packages (WP) and activities that must be included in the proposals, as described in detail in the technical specifications in the following sections: - WP 2 – Public relations; - WP 3 – Website, social media; - WP 4 – Advertising; - WP 5 – Communication tools; - WP 6 – Events. For further details, please refer to the \"Technical Specifications\", which can be downloaded from the Consorzio Tutala Vini d'Abruzzo website.",
